# Arbitrum Sepolia Live Deployments (421614)
# Vault: 0x07f9e3f0c0bb2d45300711d4f425917fa493525d
# USDG: 0x75ef6c3f8cfa9410c6d45924d96aa5b107f166fb
# Consensus: 0xe340662aad9cce18ffba38449e585fd8d7c78ae1
# Guardian Registry: 0xe09c19696990fc99c92f8eba070c36ba51cdade7

